{
  "uid": "paper-research-service",
  "title": "paper-research: service details",
  "tags": [
    "paper-research"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 50,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "transparent": true,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**How to read this.** Claude Code sends one event per prompt, model call, tool call, hook, and so on. Use the time picker above. Each row has its own help, and every panel queries on its own, so an empty panel doesn't affect the others. Hover the **i** in a panel's corner for what it counts. An empty panel usually means that event hasn't happened in the range. The links above open the other two dashboards."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Model calls",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "transparent": true,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Cache hit rate** is the share of input served from the prompt cache. A drop after a change to the plugin's rules or lessons means the change broke the cache and costs more. **Latency** is the time to the full answer; **first token** is the wait before it starts."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Model calls by model",
      "description": "Model calls per interval, by model.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (model) (count_over_time({service_name=\"claude-code\"} | event_name=\"api_request\" | query_source=~\"$query_source\" [$__interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "No data in this time range"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Model calls by source",
      "description": "sdk is the main conversation. The others run in the background: titles, suggestions, compaction.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (query_source) (count_over_time({service_name=\"claude-code\"} | event_name=\"api_request\" [$__interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{query_source}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "No data in this time range"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "API errors",
      "description": "Failed model calls, such as 429 and 5xx responses.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (model, status_code) (count_over_time({service_name=\"claude-code\"} | event_name=\"api_error\" [$__interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}} {{status_code}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "No data in this time range"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tokens by type",
      "description": "Tokens per interval. Cache reads are cheap; cache writes and output are what cost the most.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 15,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum(sum_over_time({service_name=\"claude-code\"} | event_name=\"api_request\" | unwrap input_tokens [$__interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "input",
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "range"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum(sum_over_time({service_name=\"claude-code\"} | event_name=\"api_request\" | unwrap output_tokens [$__interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "output",
          "refId": "B",
          "queryType": "range"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum(sum_over_time({service_name=\"claude-code\"} | event_name=\"api_request\" | unwrap cache_read_tokens [$__interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "cache read",
          "refId": "C",
          "queryType": "range"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum(sum_over_time({service_name=\"claude-code\"} | event_name=\"api_request\" | unwrap cache_creation_tokens [$__interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "cache write",
          "refId": "D",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "No data in this time range"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Cache hit rate",
      "description": "Cached input tokens divided by all input tokens, per interval.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 15,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum(sum_over_time({service_name=\"claude-code\"} | event_name=\"api_request\" | unwrap cache_read_tokens [$__interval])) / (sum(sum_over_time({service_name=\"claude-code\"} | event_name=\"api_request\" | unwrap cache_read_tokens [$__interval])) + sum(sum_over_time({service_name=\"claude-code\"} | event_name=\"api_request\" | unwrap cache_creation_tokens [$__interval])) + sum(sum_over_time({service_name=\"claude-code\"} | event_name=\"api_request\" | unwrap input_tokens [$__interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "hit rate",
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "No data in this time range",
          "unit": "percentunit"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latency, p50 and p95 (ms)",
      "description": "Time from request to the end of the answer.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 23,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "quantile_over_time(0.5, {service_name=\"claude-code\"} | event_name=\"api_request\" | unwrap duration_ms [$__interval]) by (model)",
          "legendFormat": "p50 {{model}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "range"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "quantile_over_time(0.95, {service_name=\"claude-code\"} | event_name=\"api_request\" | unwrap duration_ms [$__interval]) by (model)",
          "legendFormat": "p95 {{model}}",
          "refId": "B",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "No data in this time range",
          "unit": "ms"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Time to first token, p95 (ms)",
