        "x": 0,
        "y": 44,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Claude Code reports hooks by event, with the plugin's and your own merged, so they can't be told apart here. The plugin's are session start (rules, lessons), the guard before tools, and the recap check when Claude stops. **Hook time** is what they add to a session."
      }
    },
