      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Claude Code's spans, stored in Tempo. Each row is one trace. Open **Explore**, pick **Tempo**, and paste a trace id to see its spans. Needs `OTEL_TRACES_EXPORTER=otlp` and `CLAUDE_CODE_ENHANCED_TELEMETRY_BETA=1`, then a restart of Claude Code. The `trace_id` in an event's attributes is the same id."
      }
